@startuml
participant Caller
participant DependencyManifest as Manifest
participant ToolchainProbe as Probe
participant DiagnosticSet as Diagnostics
Caller -> Manifest: load(explicit path)
Manifest --> Caller: immutable lock or error
Caller -> Probe: verify(lock, explicit prefix)
Probe -> Diagnostics: append stable results
Diagnostics --> Caller: admitted or classified failure
@enduml
